<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Posts on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/</link><description>Recent content in Posts on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/post/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>金牛座守護水晶：綠髮碧璽與綠幽靈怎麼選</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%B6%A0%E9%AB%AE%E7%A2%A7%E7%92%BD%E8%88%87%E7%B6%A0%E5%B9%BD%E9%9D%88%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</link><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%B6%A0%E9%AB%AE%E7%A2%A7%E7%92%BD%E8%88%87%E7%B6%A0%E5%B9%BD%E9%9D%88%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;金牛座常見守護石是&lt;strong&gt;綠髮碧璽&lt;/strong&gt;，輔助可選綠幽靈與粉晶。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>白水晶功效與淨化：石英入門保養指南</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%99%BD%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E8%88%87%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3%E8%8B%B1%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%99%BD%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E8%88%87%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3%E8%8B%B1%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;白水晶（Clear Quartz）是無色透明至乳白色的石英。&lt;/strong&gt;「放大能量」「淨化」是水晶文化中的象徵說法，與物理清潔是兩件事。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>水瓶座守護水晶：月光石與紫水晶的搭配</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%9C%88%E5%85%89%E7%9F%B3%E8%88%87%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%9C%88%E5%85%89%E7%9F%B3%E8%88%87%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水瓶座常見守護石是&lt;strong&gt;月光石&lt;/strong&gt;，輔助可選紫水晶與天青石。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>射手座守護水晶：紫水晶與綠松石怎麼選</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E7%B6%A0%E6%9D%BE%E7%9F%B3%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E7%B6%A0%E6%9D%BE%E7%9F%B3%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;射手座常見守護石是&lt;strong&gt;紫水晶&lt;/strong&gt;，輔助可選綠松石與天河石。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>塔羅解牌完整示範：面對兩個選擇，怎麼從牌走到行動？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E8%A7%A3%E7%89%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E7%A4%BA%E7%AF%84%E9%9D%A2%E5%B0%8D%E5%85%A9%E5%80%8B%E9%81%B8%E6%93%87%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%BE%9E%E7%89%8C%E8%B5%B0%E5%88%B0%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95/</link><pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E8%A7%A3%E7%89%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E7%A4%BA%E7%AF%84%E9%9D%A2%E5%B0%8D%E5%85%A9%E5%80%8B%E9%81%B8%E6%93%87%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%BE%9E%E7%89%8C%E8%B5%B0%E5%88%B0%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;星期五下午，一封新公司的錄取通知寄來。你開心了五分鐘，接著開始算通勤、薪資、試用期，還有現在團隊那幾個真正合作得來的人。留下，還是走？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>抽到死神、高塔、惡魔怎麼辦？三張難牌的真實訊息</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8A%BD%E5%88%B0%E6%AD%BB%E7%A5%9E%E9%AB%98%E5%A1%94%E6%83%A1%E9%AD%94%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%BE%A6%E4%B8%89%E5%BC%B5%E9%9B%A3%E7%89%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</link><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8A%BD%E5%88%B0%E6%AD%BB%E7%A5%9E%E9%AB%98%E5%A1%94%E6%83%A1%E9%AD%94%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%BE%A6%E4%B8%89%E5%BC%B5%E9%9B%A3%E7%89%8C%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果朋友幫你抽牌，翻出一張死神，卻在你開口之前先皺眉說「這不太妙」，整場解讀大概已經歪掉一半。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>三張牌牌陣教學：過去、現在、未來之外還能怎麼排？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%89%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E7%89%8C%E9%99%A3%E6%95%99%E5%AD%B8%E9%81%8E%E5%8E%BB%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AA%E4%BE%86%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%96%E9%82%84%E8%83%BD%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E6%8E%92/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%89%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E7%89%8C%E9%99%A3%E6%95%99%E5%AD%B8%E9%81%8E%E5%8E%BB%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AA%E4%BE%86%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%96%E9%82%84%E8%83%BD%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E6%8E%92/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;朋友說：「我明天要跟主管談加薪，幫我抽過去、現在、未來。」我會先停一下。過去發生過什麼，主管多半也知道；明天真正需要的是知道&lt;strong&gt;現況、卡點，以及談話策略&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>塔羅逆位一定不好嗎？四種讀法與判斷順序</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E9%80%86%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%A5%BD%E5%97%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%A8%AE%E8%AE%80%E6%B3%95%E8%88%87%E5%88%A4%E6%96%B7%E9%A0%86%E5%BA%8F/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E9%80%86%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%A5%BD%E5%97%8E%E5%9B%9B%E7%A8%AE%E8%AE%80%E6%B3%95%E8%88%87%E5%88%A4%E6%96%B7%E9%A0%86%E5%BA%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;太陽牌翻出來，本來應該鬆一口氣；偏偏它是倒著的。於是剛剛那口氣又吸回去：「太陽逆位，是不是連好牌都變壞了？」&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>抽塔羅前怎麼問問題？從每日一張牌開始練習</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8A%BD%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%89%8D%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%95%8F%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E5%BE%9E%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%80%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B%E7%B7%B4%E7%BF%92/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8A%BD%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%89%8D%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%95%8F%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E5%BE%9E%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E4%B8%80%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B%E7%B7%B4%E7%BF%92/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;手機放在桌上，訊息已讀了兩小時。你拿起牌，腦中只有一句：「他到底愛不愛我？」這個問題我懂，但抽完牌之後，你可能還是只能繼續盯著手機。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>塔羅宮廷牌怎麼解？侍者、騎士、皇后、國王</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%AE%AE%E5%BB%B7%E7%89%8C%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%A7%A3%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E9%A8%8E%E5%A3%AB%E7%9A%87%E5%90%8E%E5%9C%8B%E7%8E%8B/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%AE%AE%E5%BB%B7%E7%89%8C%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%A7%A3%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E9%A8%8E%E5%A3%AB%E7%9A%87%E5%90%8E%E5%9C%8B%E7%8E%8B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;抽到聖杯皇后，很多人會開始在腦中點名：「媽媽？伴侶？上週安慰我的朋友？」翻牌才三秒，身邊的人已經被你排查一輪。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>小牌數字 1 到 10 怎麼記？從開始到完成的解牌線索</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%8F%E7%89%8C%E6%95%B8%E5%AD%971%E5%88%B010%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%A8%98%E5%BE%9E%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B%E5%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A3%E7%89%8C%E7%B7%9A%E7%B4%A2/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%8F%E7%89%8C%E6%95%B8%E5%AD%971%E5%88%B010%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%A8%98%E5%BE%9E%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B%E5%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A3%E7%89%8C%E7%B7%9A%E7%B4%A2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;翻到聖杯七，記一個意思；翻到寶劍七，又是另一個。這時如果有人說「先把 40 張數字牌背完」，我大概會先把牌收起來。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>權杖、聖杯、寶劍、錢幣：四牌組怎麼看？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%AC%8A%E6%9D%96%E8%81%96%E6%9D%AF%E5%AF%B6%E5%8A%8D%E9%8C%A2%E5%B9%A3%E5%9B%9B%E7%89%8C%E7%B5%84%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%AC%8A%E6%9D%96%E8%81%96%E6%9D%AF%E5%AF%B6%E5%8A%8D%E9%8C%A2%E5%B9%A3%E5%9B%9B%E7%89%8C%E7%B5%84%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;同事開會時說「這案子我們一定要做！」，你心裡卻想：「大家講得很熱血，預算到底在哪？」同一場會議，前一句很權杖，後一句很錢幣。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>愚者之旅是什麼？用一條故事線讀懂 22 張大牌</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%84%9A%E8%80%85%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E6%A2%9D%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E7%B7%9A%E8%AE%80%E6%87%8222%E5%BC%B5%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%8C/</link><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%84%9A%E8%80%85%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E6%A2%9D%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E7%B7%9A%E8%AE%80%E6%87%8222%E5%BC%B5%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%8C/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;假設你帶著一只小包袱出門，沒有導航，也不知道沿途會遇到誰。這是愚者牌的開場。走到旅程終點時，你已經不是出發時的你。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>塔羅牌新手入門：78 張牌到底怎麼分？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E7%89%8C%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E5%85%A5%E9%96%8078%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%88%86/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E7%89%8C%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E5%85%A5%E9%96%8078%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%88%86/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;一副新塔羅牌拆封後，最有壓力的可能不是抽到什麼牌，而是那疊厚得像考試範圍的牌卡：&lt;strong&gt;78 張，難道要全部背起來？&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>12星座對應脈輪指南：找到你最需要平衡的能量中心</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%B0%8D%E6%87%89%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%80%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</link><pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%B0%8D%E6%87%89%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%80%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;占星與脈輪，是兩套不同的系統——但它們&lt;strong&gt;互相對應&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>巨蟹座性格全解析：水象開創宮的情感堡壘與母性能量</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B7%A8%E8%9F%B9%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E6%84%9F%E5%A0%A1%E5%A3%98%E8%88%87%E6%AF%8D%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</link><pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B7%A8%E8%9F%B9%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E6%84%9F%E5%A0%A1%E5%A3%98%E8%88%87%E6%AF%8D%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;巨蟹座的符號是一隻&lt;strong&gt;螃蟹&lt;/strong&gt;——一個有堅硬外殼但內在柔軟的生物。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;這個符號是了解巨蟹座的鑰匙。&lt;strong&gt;他們的硬，是用來保護裡面的柔軟&lt;/strong&gt;。當你看見一個巨蟹座表面冷淡、不易親近——那不是他們真實的樣子，那是他們的殼。真正的巨蟹是十二星座中&lt;strong&gt;內心最柔軟、最有同理心、最重感情&lt;/strong&gt;的——但他們不會輕易讓你看見裡面，除非你證明你不會傷害他們。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>牡羊座性格全解析：火象開創宮的能量、優勢與成長課題</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%84%AA%E5%8B%A2%E8%88%87%E6%88%90%E9%95%B7%E8%AA%B2%E9%A1%8C/</link><pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%84%AA%E5%8B%A2%E8%88%87%E6%88%90%E9%95%B7%E8%AA%B2%E9%A1%8C/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;牡羊座是&lt;strong&gt;黃道十二宮的第一個星座&lt;/strong&gt;——這個位置不是隨便排的。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>射手座性格全解析：火象變動宮的真理探索與自由靈魂</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%86%E6%8E%A2%E7%B4%A2%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E9%9D%88%E9%AD%82/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%86%E6%8E%A2%E7%B4%A2%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E9%9D%88%E9%AD%82/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;射手座的符號是&lt;strong&gt;半人馬射出的箭&lt;/strong&gt;——一個一半是人、一半是馬的存在，正在把箭瞄向遠方。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>天蠍座性格全解析：水象固定宮的深度轉化與重生力量</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A0%8D%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%BD%89%E5%8C%96%E8%88%87%E9%87%8D%E7%94%9F%E5%8A%9B%E9%87%8F/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E8%A0%8D%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%BD%89%E5%8C%96%E8%88%87%E9%87%8D%E7%94%9F%E5%8A%9B%E9%87%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果說獅子座是太陽——光芒外放，所有人都能看見；那天蠍座就是&lt;strong&gt;深海&lt;/strong&gt;——表面平靜，深處卻有完全另一個世界。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>接地、能量淨化、冥想：脈輪日常療癒三大實作技巧</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%A6%E4%BD%9C%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/</link><pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E4%B8%89%E5%A4%A7%E5%AF%A6%E4%BD%9C%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果說脈輪療癒有一套&lt;strong&gt;最低限度的日常保養 SOP&lt;/strong&gt;，那就是這三件事：&lt;strong&gt;接地（Grounding）、能量淨化（Energy Cleansing）、冥想（Meditation）&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>獅子座性格全解析：火象固定宮的舞台魅力與領袖之心</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%88%9E%E5%8F%B0%E9%AD%85%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E9%A0%98%E8%A2%96%E4%B9%8B%E5%BF%83/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%88%9E%E5%8F%B0%E9%AD%85%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E9%A0%98%E8%A2%96%E4%B9%8B%E5%BF%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;獅子座是十二星座裡，&lt;strong&gt;唯一被太陽守護的星座&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>脈輪失衡怎麼理解？七個自我覺察提問</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%A4%B1%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E8%A6%8B%E5%BE%B5%E5%85%86%E8%BA%AB%E5%BF%83%E8%AD%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E6%87%82%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</link><pubDate>Sun, 31 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%A4%B1%E8%A1%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%B8%B8%E8%A6%8B%E5%BE%B5%E5%85%86%E8%BA%AB%E5%BF%83%E8%AD%A6%E8%A8%8A%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E6%87%82%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;最近睡不好、容易焦慮，會不會是「某個脈輪失衡」？先別急著替身體找靈性答案。**脈輪是文化與自我反思的框架，不是診斷工具。**頭痛、疼痛、失眠、情緒低落等情況，都不能靠勾選清單判定成哪一輪出了問題。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>雙子座性格全解析：風象變動宮的好奇雙面與心智宇宙</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%BD%E5%A5%87%E9%9B%99%E9%9D%A2%E8%88%87%E5%BF%83%E6%99%BA%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99/</link><pubDate>Sat, 30 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%BD%E5%A5%87%E9%9B%99%E9%9D%A2%E8%88%87%E5%BF%83%E6%99%BA%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;雙子座的符號是&lt;strong&gt;雙生子&lt;/strong&gt;——兩個一模一樣卻面向不同方向的人。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>臍輪完整指南：橘色情感之輪喚醒創造力與感官生命力</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%87%8D%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%A9%98%E8%89%B2%E6%83%85%E6%84%9F%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%96%9A%E9%86%92%E5%89%B5%E9%80%A0%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E6%84%9F%E5%AE%98%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%8A%9