scription></item><item><title>金牛座性格全解析：土象固定宮的踏實感官與生命節奏</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%B8%8F%E5%AF%A6%E6%84%9F%E5%AE%98%E8%88%87%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%AF%80%E5%A5%8F/</link><pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E8%B8%8F%E5%AF%A6%E6%84%9F%E5%AE%98%E8%88%87%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E7%AF%80%E5%A5%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果讓十二星座參加一場「&lt;strong&gt;穩&lt;/strong&gt;」的比賽，金牛座大概會贏所有人。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>眉心輪完整指南：靛色第三眼開啟直覺洞察與內在智慧</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%9D%9B%E8%89%B2%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9C%BC%E9%96%8B%E5%95%9F%E7%9B%B4%E8%A6%BA%E6%B4%9E%E5%AF%9F%E8%88%87%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%9D%9B%E8%89%B2%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%9C%BC%E9%96%8B%E5%95%9F%E7%9B%B4%E8%A6%BA%E6%B4%9E%E5%AF%9F%E8%88%87%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%A8%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;「&lt;strong&gt;第三眼&lt;/strong&gt;」是靈性圈最常被討論、也最容易被誤解的詞。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>雙魚座性格全解析：水象變動宮的夢境靈性與宇宙之愛</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A2%E5%A2%83%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%88%87%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%9B/</link><pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A2%E5%A2%83%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%88%87%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%9B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;雙魚座是黃道十二宮的最後一個星座——這個位置不是隨便排的。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>七大脈輪守護水晶速查表：每個脈輪該配什麼石頭最有感</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%80%9F%E6%9F%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A9%B2%E9%85%8D%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD%E6%9C%80%E6%9C%89%E6%84%9F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水晶療癒這幾年很紅——但很多人買了一堆水晶，卻不知道&lt;strong&gt;哪個對應哪個脈輪&lt;/strong&gt;、&lt;strong&gt;該怎麼搭配&lt;/strong&gt;。買到對的水晶，能感覺能量明顯改變；買到不對的或亂配，效果就只是「漂亮」。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>心輪完整指南：綠色愛之輪打開人際連結與自我慈悲</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B6%A0%E8%89%B2%E6%84%9B%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E6%89%93%E9%96%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%9B%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E6%85%88%E6%82%B2/</link><pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B6%A0%E8%89%B2%E6%84%9B%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E6%89%93%E9%96%8B%E4%BA%BA%E9%9A%9B%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E8%88%87%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E6%85%88%E6%82%B2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果問你：「&lt;strong&gt;你愛自己嗎？&lt;/strong&gt;」——你的第一反應會是什麼？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>水瓶座性格全解析：風象固定宮的創新前衛與人道精神</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0%E5%89%8D%E8%A1%9B%E8%88%87%E4%BA%BA%E9%81%93%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E/</link><pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0%E5%89%8D%E8%A1%9B%E8%88%87%E4%BA%BA%E9%81%93%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水瓶座的中文名字常讓人誤會——以為「&lt;strong&gt;水瓶&lt;/strong&gt;」是水象星座。其實不是，水瓶座是&lt;strong&gt;風象星座&lt;/strong&gt;，符號的水瓶倒出的也不是水，是**「知識之水」**。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>處女座性格全解析：土象變動宮的分析力與服務之愛</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%9B/</link><pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%8A%9B%E8%88%87%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E4%B9%8B%E6%84%9B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;處女座是十二星座裡，&lt;strong&gt;最容易被誤解的一個&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>天秤座性格全解析：風象開創宮的平衡美學與夥伴關係</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%B8%E8%88%87%E5%A4%A5%E4%BC%B4%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82/</link><pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%B8%E8%88%87%E5%A4%A5%E4%BC%B4%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;天秤座是十二星座裡唯一&lt;strong&gt;以「物品」為符號&lt;/strong&gt;的星座——不是動物、不是人，而是一個&lt;strong&gt;天秤&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>頂輪完整指南：紫色冠之輪連結宇宙意識與靈性圓滿</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%A0%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E8%88%87%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%93%E6%BB%BF/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%AB%E8%89%B2%E5%86%A0%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E8%88%87%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%93%E6%BB%BF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;七大脈輪走到最後，到了頭頂——這是**頂輪（Sahasrara, Crown Chakra）**所在的位置，也是整套能量地圖的盡頭。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>七大脈輪完整入門：從海底輪到頂輪的能量地圖一次看懂</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E5%BE%9E%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%88%B0%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%B0%E5%9C%96%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E7%9C%8B%E6%87%82/</link><pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E5%BE%9E%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%88%B0%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%B0%E5%9C%96%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E7%9C%8B%E6%87%82/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;「脈輪」這個詞，這幾年從瑜伽課堂、靈氣療癒到 IG 命理帳號到處都看得到。可是真的問起來：&lt;strong&gt;七個脈輪是哪七個？順序怎麼排？為什麼有對應顏色和水晶？要從哪一個開始練？&lt;/strong&gt;——能完整答得出來的人其實不多。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>摩羯座性格全解析：土象開創宮的紀律野心與時間哲學</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%91%A9%E7%BE%AF%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%B4%80%E5%BE%8B%E9%87%8E%E5%BF%83%E8%88%87%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%B8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%91%A9%E7%BE%AF%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E7%B4%80%E5%BE%8B%E9%87%8E%E5%BF%83%E8%88%87%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;要懂摩羯座，得先懂一件事：&lt;strong&gt;他們是十二星座裡，唯一把「時間」當朋友的人。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;別人怕老、怕慢、怕等不到，摩羯座剛好相反——他們知道好東西要熬，目標要分十年達成，山要一步一步爬。如果你身邊有摩羯，你可能注意過：他們很少說大話，但說過的話幾乎都做到了；他們不會在第一年就閃閃發光，可是十年後回頭看，他們是同齡人裡爬最高的那一個。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>海底輪完整指南：紅色根之輪如何打造安全感與接地能量</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%85%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%B9%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%84%9F%E8%88%87%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</link><pubDate>Sun, 10 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B4%85%E8%89%B2%E6%A0%B9%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%84%9F%E8%88%87%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果你曾經在凌晨三點醒來，胸口悶悶地，腦袋一片亂，又說不出到底在擔心什麼——那種「&lt;strong&gt;好像有什麼地方不安全&lt;/strong&gt;」的感覺，往往不是真的有事，而是你的**海底輪（Muladhara, Root Chakra）**正在跟你說話。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>喉輪是什麼？顏色、開啟徵兆、阻塞與對應水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%96%89%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%97%8D%E8%89%B2%E8%A1%A8%E9%81%94%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E8%AA%AA%E5%87%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%88%87%E5%89%B5%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%81%B2/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%96%89%E8%BC%AA%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%97%8D%E8%89%B2%E8%A1%A8%E9%81%94%E4%B9%8B%E8%BC%AA%E8%AA%AA%E5%87%BA%E7%9C%9F%E5%AF%A6%E8%88%87%E5%89%B5%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E8%81%B2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;你有沒有過這種經驗？心裡明明有滿滿的話想說，可是話到嘴邊就吞回去；或是會議上明明知道答案，卻在被點到那一刻喉嚨突然發乾、聲音變小、整個人縮了起來？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>天秤座守護水晶完整指南：葡萄石與青金石的能量搭配</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84%E7%9F%B3%E8%88%87%E9%9D%92%E9%87%91%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84%E7%9F%B3%E8%88%87%E9%9D%92%E9%87%91%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;天秤座的人生，是一場永恆的秤量——這邊多一點好呢，還是那邊多一點？這個選擇更對呢，還是那個？當所有人都在往前衝的時候，天秤座站在十字路口，認真地想要找到那個最公平、最美好、最不傷害任何人的答案。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>獅子座守護石是什麼？金髮晶、太陽石怎麼搭配</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%87%91%E9%AB%AE%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%87%91%E9%AB%AE%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;獅子座守護石是什麼？本站以金髮晶為主石，太陽石為輔助石，對應自信與溫暖的文化意象。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>黑碧璽功效完整解析：最強大地守護石</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%91%E7%A2%A7%E7%92%BD%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%9C%80%E5%BC%B7%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E7%9F%B3/</link><pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%BB%91%E7%A2%A7%E7%92%BD%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E6%9C%80%E5%BC%B7%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E7%9F%B3/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如果水晶世界裡有一位沉默的守門人，那一定是黑碧璽。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;它不像&lt;a href="https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%81%B8/"&gt;紫水晶&lt;/a&gt;那樣散發著靈性的紫光，也不像粉水晶那樣帶著甜蜜的粉紅——黑碧璽是徹底的黑，深沉、不透光、毫不張揚。但正是這份沉穩的黑，讓它成為水晶療癒領域中最被信賴的防護石。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>風象星座能量解析：雙子天秤水瓶的風之性格與守護水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%A8%E4%B9%8B%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><pubDate>Thu, 23 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%A8%E4%B9%8B%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;風有很多種吹拂的方式——有的是春天的穿堂風，在每扇窗之間穿梭，帶來各個房間的消息；有的是傍晚的微風，溫柔地拂過水面，讓一切歸於和諧的漣漪；有的是高空的氣流，看不見摸不著，卻悄悄改變了整片天空的走向。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>12星座守護石對照表（2026）：生日／幸運水晶一次查</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%B0%8D%E7%85%A7%E8%A1%A8%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E7%9F%B3/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/12%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E5%B0%8D%E7%85%A7%E8%A1%A8%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E7%9F%B3/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;12 星座守護石是什麼？這是一份按星座整理主石與輔助石的文化象徵對照表。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>水象星座能量解析：巨蟹天蠍雙魚的深海性格與守護水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%B7%A8%E8%9F%B9%E5%A4%A9%E8%A0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B7%B1%E6%B5%B7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E5%B7%A8%E8%9F%B9%E5%A4%A9%E8%A0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%B7%B1%E6%B5%B7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水有很多種存在的方式——有的是溫暖的泉眼，從地底源源不絕地湧出，滋養著身邊的每一寸土地；有的是深不見底的海溝，表面看似平靜，底下卻藏著驚人的壓力與暗流；有的是無邊際的薄霧，瀰漫在空氣中，觸碰不到卻無處不在。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>火象星座能量解析：牡羊獅子射手的火焰性格與守護水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%81%AB%E7%84%B0%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%81%AB%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%81%AB%E7%84%B0%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;火焰有很多種燃燒的方式——有的像剛擦亮的火柴，瞬間點燃整片黑暗；有的像壁爐裡的炭火，持續散發溫暖的光芒；有的像營火的火星，隨風飄散到意想不到的遠方。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>牡羊座守護水晶完整指南：海藍寶與紅碧玉的能量搭配</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%B5%B7%E8%97%8D%E5%AF%B6%E8%88%87%E7%B4%85%E7%A2%A7%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%89%A1%E7%BE%8A%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%B5%B7%E8%97%8D%E5%AF%B6%E8%88%87%E7%B4%85%E7%A2%A7%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;牡羊座的能量像一把剛點燃的火焰——燃燒得又快又烈，照亮了整個房間，卻也偶爾不小心燙到身邊的人。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>處女座守護石是什麼？粉水晶與藍紋瑪瑙怎麼選</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B2%89%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E8%97%8D%E7%B4%8B%E7%91%AA%E7%91%99%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E7%B2%89%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E8%97%8D%E7%B4%8B%E7%91%AA%E7%91%99%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;處女座守護石是什麼？本站以粉水晶為主石，藍紋瑪瑙為輔助石；配對是文化象徵。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>土象星座能量解析：金牛處女摩羯的大地性格與守護水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E6%91%A9%E7%BE%AF%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%B0%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><pubDate>Tue, 21 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%87%91%E7%89%9B%E8%99%95%E5%A5%B3%E6%91%A9%E7%BE%AF%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%B0%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;大地有很多種存在的方式——有的是春天的沃土，溫暖而肥沃，萬物都想在這裡扎根；有的是精心打理的花園，每一寸都被仔細安排，沒有一片葉子是多餘的；有的是高聳入雲的山岩，歷經風霜卻紋風不動，頂端的風景只屬於願意攀登的人。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶 x 眉心輪 &amp; 頂輪：一顆石頭，同時打開兩個靈性能量中心</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E8%88%87%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E8%84%88%E8%BC%AA%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%9C%89%E5%BF%83%E8%BC%AA%E8%88%87%E9%A0%82%E8%BC%AA%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;大多數水晶只對應一個脈輪。紫水晶不一樣——它同時連結眉心輪和頂輪，也就是七脈輪體系裡最頂端的兩個能量中心。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶功效：左右手、愛情、五行與助眠說法整理</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%81%B8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%8A%9F%E6%95%88%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9D%88%E6%80%A7%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%81%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在水晶店走了一圈，最後手裡還是捧著一顆紫水晶——你不孤單，幾乎每個人的起點都在這裡。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶怎麼用？冥想、助眠、空間淨化實戰完整指南</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E5%8A%A9%E7%9C%A0%E7%A9%BA%E9%96%93%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%A6%E6%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E5%86%A5%E6%83%B3%E5%8A%A9%E7%9C%A0%E7%A9%BA%E9%96%93%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E5%AF%A6%E6%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;買了紫水晶，然後呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶星座配對：雙魚、水瓶、射手為什麼特別有緣？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%85%8D%E5%B0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%82%BA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%89%B9%E5%88%A5%E6%9C%89%E7%B7%A3/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%85%8D%E5%B0%8D%E9%9B%99%E9%AD%9A%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%B0%84%E6%89%8B%E7%82%BA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%89%B9%E5%88%A5%E6%9C%89%E7%B7%A3/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;同樣一顆紫水晶，有人戴了感覺渾身舒暢，有人帶了幾個月幾乎沒感覺。這不全然是「信不信的問題」——星座跟水晶的共振確實有差。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>紫水晶淨化方法完整指南：月光浴、煙燻、聲音療癒怎麼選？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%9C%88%E5%85%89%E6%B5%B4%E7%85%99%E7%87%BB%E8%81%B2%E9%9F%B3%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%B4%AB%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E6%B7%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E6%9C%88%E5%85%89%E6%B5%B4%E7%85%99%E7%87%BB%E8%81%B2%E9%9F%B3%E7%99%82%E7%99%92%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E9%81%B8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水晶需要淨化——這件事很多人知道，但真正做到的不多。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>誕生石怎麼選？先分清月份寶石與星座守護石</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8F%AD%E9%96%8B%E8%AA%95%E7%94%9F%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E9%9D%A2%E7%B4%97%E6%8F%AD%E9%96%8B%E6%AF%8F%E9%A1%86%E5%AF%B6%E7%9F%B3%E8%83%8C%E5%BE%8C%E9%9A%B1%E8%97%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E7%BE%A9%E5%92%8C%E5%80%8B%E6%80%A7/</link><pubDate>Wed, 14 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8F%AD%E9%96%8B%E8%AA%95%E7%94%9F%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E9%9D%A2%E7%B4%97%E6%8F%AD%E9%96%8B%E6%AF%8F%E9%A1%86%E5%AF%B6%E7%9F%B3%E8%83%8C%E5%BE%8C%E9%9A%B1%E8%97%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E7%BE%A9%E5%92%8C%E5%80%8B%E6%80%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;查「誕生石」時，你可能同時看到月份表和十二星座表，兩張表卻選出不同的石頭。問題通常不在你記錯，而是&lt;strong&gt;它們使用不同的分類方式&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>「渣女星座」可信嗎？看感情界線，不看排行榜</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B8%A3%E5%A5%B3%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%9012%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%80%E5%85%B7%E6%AF%92%E8%88%8C%E7%8B%A1%E7%8C%BE%E5%BF%83%E6%A9%9F%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%B3%E7%A5%9E%E5%80%91/</link><pubDate>Tue, 13 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B8%A3%E5%A5%B3%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%9012%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E4%B8%AD%E6%9C%80%E5%85%B7%E6%AF%92%E8%88%8C%E7%8B%A1%E7%8C%BE%E5%BF%83%E6%A9%9F%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%B3%E7%A5%9E%E5%80%91/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;「她是天蠍座，難怪心機重。」聽到這句話，先停一下：這是對一個人的觀察，還是把星座與性別當成判決？&lt;strong&gt;星座不能替任何人的行為定罪，性別也不能。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>星座能看出誰不忠誠嗎？五種常見感情標籤</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%9A%E6%B8%A3%E7%94%B7%E6%B8%A3%E5%A5%B3%E7%9A%845%E5%80%8B%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7/</link><pubDate>Tue, 30 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%9A%E6%B8%A3%E7%94%B7%E6%B8%A3%E5%A5%B3%E7%9A%845%E5%80%8B%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;朋友說「那個星座都很花心」，你可能會想起某段不愉快的關係。但&lt;strong&gt;出生日期不能判定一個人是否忠誠&lt;/strong&gt;。與其列出「最渣」排行榜，不如看看常見標籤背後，真正需要談的是什麼。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>六月星座運勢怎麼讀？12 星座的自我提問</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/6%E6%9C%8812%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/</link><pubDate>Mon, 29 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/6%E6%9C%8812%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;六月到了，你想先整理哪件事？這篇保留原本十二星座的閱讀形式，改成每月可用的提問卡。&lt;strong&gt;以下是占星文化的意象，不是今年六月的天象預測，也不能保證個人事件會發生。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>考運最好的星座？五種備考提問比排名實用</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%80%83%E9%81%8B%E7%88%86%E8%A1%A8%E7%9A%84top5%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%80%83%E9%81%8B%E7%88%86%E8%A1%A8%E7%9A%84top5%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;考前看到「本月考運第一名」，很容易想替自己找一點信心。這份鼓勵可以收下；&lt;strong&gt;成績不會由星座排名決定&lt;/strong&gt;。原文列了五個星座，這裡改用五種意象，幫你檢查準備是否到位。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>命理能幫你想職涯問題嗎？把象徵提示變成行動</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%91%BD%E9%81%8B%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E9%81%8B%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E6%A5%AD%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%91%BD%E9%81%8B%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E9%81%8B%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E6%A5%AD%E7%99%BC%E5%B1%95/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;想換工作時，有人會先看命盤；有人先打開求職網站。兩件事可以並存，但用途要分清：&lt;strong&gt;命理提供詮釋角度，職涯決定仍需現實資料。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>星座財運怎麼看？把運勢提醒變成理財檢查</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E6%8F%AD%E7%A4%BA%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E8%B2%A1%E5%AF%8C%E6%A9%9F%E6%9C%83/</link><pubDate>Wed, 24 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E6%8F%AD%E7%A4%BA%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E8%B2%A1%E5%AF%8C%E6%A9%9F%E6%9C%83/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;星座文章提到「財運好」，你會想到加薪、存到錢，還是投資獲利？這三件事的條件不同。&lt;strong&gt;星座不能預測收入或報酬&lt;/strong&gt;；如果喜歡看運勢，可以把它當成提醒自己檢查財務習慣的起點。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>星座配對怎麼看？比相容度更有用的四個問題</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%88%87%E6%84%9B%E6%83%85%E6%89%BE%E5%B0%8B%E8%88%87%E6%82%A8%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E6%9C%80%E7%9B%B8%E9%85%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%B4%E4%BE%B6/</link><pubDate>Tue, 23 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%88%87%E6%84%9B%E6%83%85%E6%89%BE%E5%B0%8B%E8%88%87%E6%82%A8%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E6%9C%80%E7%9B%B8%E9%85%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%B4%E4%BE%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;看到「你們的星座很合」，心裡可能鬆一口氣；看到「不合」，又開始擔心。星座配對可以拿來聊彼此的期待，&lt;strong&gt;不能替你判斷一個人會不會尊重你&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>開運儀式怎麼用？把願望落在日常行動</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%A7%98%E8%A8%A3%E8%88%87%E5%84%80%E5%BC%8F/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E9%81%8B%E5%8B%A2%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E5%91%BD%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E7%A7%98%E8%A8%A3%E8%88%87%E5%84%80%E5%BC%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在重要日子拜拜、整理房間，或把一顆喜歡的石頭放在桌上，可能讓人更願意停下來想：我到底希望什麼改變？儀式可以是提醒，&lt;strong&gt;結果仍取決於具體行動與外在條件&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>